WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.680
Before the genetic alphabet was understood, Fischer had already charted the purines:

2
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.120
he gave the class its name, synthesized purine itself in 1898, and prepared on the

3
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:22.760
order of 130 derivatives—caffeine, the uric acid of gout, and the bases later read

4
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.940
as letters of the code.

5
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:30.753
That work, alongside his sugars, won him the 1902 Nobel Prize in Chemistry, the

6
00:00:30.753 --> 00:00:31.913
second ever awarded.

7
00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:38.067
His lock and key principle that a molecule's shape, not just its formula, decides

8
00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:42.347
what it can do is the idea every drug in this chapter exploits.
